--
dropped the body
--
__invoke_impl<_Partial<_Transform, ...>> and __invoke kept their bodies
only when the call of the _Partial closure object selected its
two-parameter operator() template.  Inside __invoke, instantiated from
_Binder::_S_call in _Partial::operator(), the pack expansion in
`typename decltype(_S_test<_Callable, _Args...>(0))::type' kept one
element: the single-element pack substitution of the body removed every
ellipsis, including those of patterns naming only __invoke's own
two-element pack.  N5008 [temp.variadic]/8-9.  The header-free reduction
is cpp20_call_result_through_pack_in_static_member_template.
